### Prompt — Rebuild WealthWise AI Architecture Documentation

Remove the old/outdated AI architecture documentation and replace it with **one accurate, structured technical document** based on the current codebase.

The document should be **detailed but not unnecessarily huge**. Use **multiple focused Mermaid flow diagrams** instead of one massive diagram.

---

## 1. Overall Architecture

### System Components

| Component | Technology | Port | Role |
|-----------|-----------|------|------|
| Frontend | Next.js | 3000 / 3001 / 3002 | User interface |
| Django Backend | Django REST Framework | 8000 | Auth, CRUD, single source of truth for users/transactions/budgets/goals/alerts/insights |
| ML-Backend | FastAPI | 8100 | AI chat, agent routing, Ollama orchestration, duplicate detection |
| Ollama | Local LLM server | 11434 | LLM inference (`llama3.2`, `qwen3:4b`), embeddings (`nomic-embed-text`) |

### Data Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    U[User]
    F[Frontend<br/>Next.js :3000]
    D[Django Backend<br/>:8000]
    M[ML-Backend<br/>FastAPI :8100]
    O[Ollama<br/>:11434]
    DB[(Database)]

    U -->|HTTP| F
    F -->|REST / GraphQL| D
    F -->|Direct AI calls| M
    D -->|Proxy AI requests| M
    M -->|/api/chat| O
    M -->|/api/users/me/<br/>/api/transactions/<br/>/api/budgets/<br/>/api/goals/<br/>/api/alerts/<br/>/api/insights/| D
    D -->|SQL| DB
```

**Key points:**
- Frontend calls ML-Backend directly for AI chat endpoints (`/chat/agent`, `/reports/*`)
- ML-Backend validates auth by forwarding JWT to Django `/api/users/me/`
- ML-Backend fetches all financial data from Django REST API
- ML-Backend calls Ollama for LLM inference and embeddings
- Django is the single source of truth for auth and financial data

