### Agent Selection Logic

**The backend router selects the agent first.** Ollama does NOT choose agents.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[User Message] --> B{agent field provided?}
    B -->|Yes| C[get_agent alias resolution]
    B -->|No| D[classify_intent via Ollama]
    C --> E[Intent enum from registry]
    D --> E
    E --> F[route_intent dispatches to handler]
    F --> G[Agent handler executes]
    G --> H[Response returned]
```

**Actual implementation:**
1. If `agent` is provided in request body → resolve via `get_agent()` in `app/services/agents.py:163-180`
2. If no `agent` → auto-classify intent using `classify_intent()` which calls Ollama
3. Map resolved intent to handler via `route_intent()` in `app/services/router.py:58-284`
4. Execute handler function
5. Return `{"intent", "response", "data", "filters", "fallback"}`

### Agent-to-Ollama Mapping

| Agent | Calls Ollama? | Purpose |
|-------|--------------|---------|
| `transaction_search` | Yes | `_extract_transaction_filters` extracts filters from NL query |
| `report` | Yes | `generate_report_narrative` creates narrative from sections |
| `chart_alert` | Yes | `explain_chart_or_alert` generates explanation |
| `alert` | Yes | `answer_alerts_question` generates alert analysis |
| `goal` | Yes | `answer_goal_question` generates goal planning response |
| `budget` | Yes | `answer_budget_question` generates budget analysis |
| `insights` | Yes | `answer_insights_question` generates insights response |
| `general_chat` | No | Returns static agent list; no Ollama call |
| `db_context` | No | Returns database schema context; no Ollama call |

### Agent Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Q[User Query] --> R[Router / Agent Selection]
    R -->|search| TS[Transaction Search Agent]
    R -->|report| RP[Report Agent]
    R -->|chart_alert| CA[Chart/Alert Agent]
    R -->|alert| AL[Alert Agent]
    R -->|goal| GL[Goal Agent]
    R -->|budget| BG[Budget Agent]
    R -->|insights| IN[Insights Agent]
    R -->|chat| GC[General Chat Agent]
    R -->|db| DB[Database Context Agent]

    TS -->|uses| TS_Tools[search_transactions_nl<br/>_extract_transaction_filters]
    RP -->|uses| RP_Tools[build_report<br/>build_report_sections]
    CA -->|uses| CA_Tools[explain_chart_or_alert]
    AL -->|uses| AL_Tools[answer_alerts_question]
    GL -->|uses| GL_Tools[answer_goal_question]
    BG -->|uses| BG_Tools[answer_budget_question]
    IN -->|uses| IN_Tools[answer_insights_question]
    GC -->|uses| GC_Tools[Static agent list]
    DB -->|uses| DB_Tools[answer_database_question]

    TS_Tools -->|calls| O1[Ollama]
    RP_Tools -->|calls| O2[Ollama]
    CA_Tools -->|calls| O3[Ollama]
    AL_Tools -->|calls| O4[Ollama]
    GL_Tools -->|calls| O5[Ollama]
    BG_Tools -->|calls| O6[Ollama]
    IN_Tools -->|calls| O7[Ollama]
    GC_Tools -->|no call| X[None]
    DB_Tools -->|no call| X
```

