```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8100/chat/agent \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "agent": "search",
    "message": "Show me all Starbucks transactions over $50"
  }'
```

**Flow:**
```
curl
 → POST /chat/agent
 → get_agent lookup
 → route_intent
 → search_transactions_nl
 → _extract_transaction_filters [Ollama]
 → GET /api/transactions/
 → Response
```

