## 9. Debugging Reference

### Debug Endpoints

| Endpoint | Purpose | Auth Required |
|----------|---------|---------------|
| `GET /health` | Health check | No |
| `GET /debug/traces` | List all debug traces | Yes |
| `GET /debug/traces/{request_id}` | Get specific trace | Yes |
| `POST /debug/events` | Append debug event | Yes |
| `GET /debug/stream` | SSE stream of debug events | Yes |
| `POST /debug/test/flow` | Test debug flow | Yes |

### Where to Debug

| Issue | Debug Location | File | Function |
|-------|---------------|------|----------|
| Agent fails to resolve | Agent lookup | `app/services/agents.py:163-180` | `get_agent()` |
| Wrong agent selected | Intent classification | `app/services/intent.py` | `classify_intent()` |
| Router dispatch fails | Agent routing | `app/services/router.py:58-284` | `route_intent()` |
| Tool data empty | Tool function | `app/services/tools.py` | Individual tool functions |
| Django API error | HTTP client | `app/clients.py` | `get_transactions`, etc. |
| Ollama timeout | Ollama adapter | `app/ollama.py:91-134` | `generate()` |
| Ollama invalid response | Filter parsing | `app/services/tools.py:24-46` | `_extract_transaction_filters()` |
| Response parsing error | JSON parsing | `app/services/tools.py:40-44` | `json.loads()` |
| Auth failure | Middleware | `app/middleware.py:91-141` | `verify_jwt()` |

### Logs

| Log Type | Logger Name | File |
|----------|-------------|------|
| Request logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:48-66` |
| Agent logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:139-164` |
| Tool call logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:69-85` |
| LLM call logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:88-104` |
| Validation logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:194-219` |
| Error logs | `ml_backend` | `app/logging_utils.py:222-234` |
| Ollama logs | `ml_backend` | `app/ollama.py:54-71` |

### Debug Store

The in-memory debug store (`app/debug_events.py`) tracks:
- `USER_REQUEST` - Initial request received
- `INTENT_DETECTION` - Intent classification
- `AGENT_SELECTION` - Agent chosen
- `BACKEND_REQUEST` - Backend API call
- `DATA_RETRIEVAL` - Data fetching
- `OLLAMA_REQUEST` - Ollama call started
- `OLLAMA_RESPONSE` - Ollama call completed
- `RESPONSE_PARSING` - Response processing
- `FRONTEND_RENDER` - Final response ready
- `ERROR` - Any error

