## 10. Current Architecture Summary

### Actual Agents (9)

| Agent | Handler | Ollama? | Tools |
|-------|---------|---------|-------|
| `transaction_search` | `search_transactions_nl` | Yes | `_extract_transaction_filters`, `get_transactions` |
| `report` | `build_report` | Yes | `get_transactions_tool`, `get_income_tool`, `get_balance_tool`, `get_budget_tool`, `get_goals_tool` |
| `chart_alert` | `explain_chart_or_alert` | Yes | None (data passed directly) |
| `alert` | `answer_alerts_question` | Yes | `get_alerts_tool` |
| `goal` | `answer_goal_question` | Yes | `get_goals_tool`, `get_profile_tool` |
| `budget` | `answer_budget_question` | Yes | `get_transactions_tool`, `get_budget_tool`, `get_profile_tool` |
| `insights` | `answer_insights_question` | Yes | `get_insights` |
| `general_chat` | Static response | No | None |
| `db_context` | `answer_database_question` | Yes | `get_database_context` |

### Actual Routes

| Route | Method | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `/health` | GET | Health check |
| `/chat/agent` | POST | Main agent endpoint |
| `/reports/generate` | POST | Generate report |
| `/reports/summary` | GET | Report summary |
| `/reports/explain` | POST | Explain chart/alert |
| `/debug/traces` | GET | List traces |
| `/debug/traces/{id}` | GET | Get trace |
| `/debug/events` | POST | Append event |
| `/debug/stream` | GET | SSE stream |
| `/debug/test/flow` | POST | Test flow |
| `/debug/traces` | DELETE | Clear traces |
| `/chats` | GET | List conversations |
| `/chats` | POST | Create conversation |
| `/chats/{id}` | GET | Get conversation |
| `/chats/{id}` | PATCH | Update conversation |
| `/chats/{id}` | DELETE | Delete conversation |
| `/chats/{id}/messages` | POST | Add message |
| `/user/memory` | GET | List memories |
| `/user/memory/{id}` | DELETE | Delete memory |
| `/user/memory` | DELETE | Delete all memories |
| `/duplicates` | POST | Check duplicates |
| `/chat/db/refresh` | POST | Refresh DB context |

